+	 * The change that was in flight has landed, one way or the other, so
+	 * say so: a client that asked during the release was told -ENOLCK and
+	 * may have stopped asking. h713-tv gives a change two seconds of
+	 * retries, and a release can take longer than that (up to 1.5 s until
